## 📚 第五铁律：可维护性与可扩展性 (Maintainability & Scalability)

### 🏗️ 架构可扩展性

**AI必须考虑的可扩展性原则：**

#### 1️⃣ SOLID原则

**S - 单一职责原则 (Single Responsibility)**
```typescript
// ❌ 违反：一个类做多件事
class UserManager {
  createUser(data) { /*...*/ }
  deleteUser(id) { /*...*/ }
  sendEmail(user, message) { /*...*/ }
  generateReport(users) { /*...*/ }
  exportToExcel(data) { /*...*/ }
}

// ✅ 遵循：每个类只做一件事
class UserService {
  createUser(data: CreateUserDto): Promise<User> { /*...*/ }
  deleteUser(id: string): Promise<void> { /*...*/ }
}

class EmailService {
  send(to: string, message: string): Promise<void> { /*...*/ }
}

class ReportService {
  generateUserReport(users: User[]): Report { /*...*/ }
}

class ExcelExporter {
  export(data: any[]): Buffer { /*...*/ }
}
```

**O - 开闭原则 (Open-Closed)**
```typescript
// ❌ 违反：修改需要改动核心代码
function formatData(data: any, type: string) {
  if (type === 'json') return JSON.stringify(data);
  if (type === 'xml') return toXML(data);
  if (type === 'csv') return toCSV(data);
  // 添加新格式需要修改这里
}

// ✅ 遵循：对扩展开放，对修改封闭
interface Formatter {
  format(data: unknown): string;
}

class JsonFormatter implements Formatter {
  format(data: unknown): string {
    return JSON.stringify(data);
  }
}

class XmlFormatter implements Formatter {
  format(data: unknown): string {
    return toXML(data);
  }
}

// 添加新格式只需要创建新类
class YamlFormatter implements Formatter {
  format(data: unknown): string {
    return toYAML(data);
  }
}

class FormatterRegistry {
  private formatters = new Map<string, Formatter>();
  
  register(type: string, formatter: Formatter): void {
    this.formatters.set(type, formatter);
  }
  
  format(data: unknown, type: string): string {
    const formatter = this.formatters.get(type);
    if (!formatter) {
      throw new Error(`Unknown format: ${type}`);
    }
    return formatter.format(data);
  }
}

// 使用
const registry = new FormatterRegistry();
registry.register('json', new JsonFormatter());
registry.register('xml', new XmlFormatter());
registry.register('yaml', new YamlFormatter());
```

**L - 里氏替换原则 (Liskov Substitution)**
```typescript
// ❌ 违反：子类改变了父类的行为
class Rectangle {
  constructor(protected width: number, protected height: number) {}
  
  setWidth(width: number) { this.width = width; }
  setHeight(height: number) { this.height = height; }
  
  area(): number {
    return this.width * this.height;
  }
}

class Square extends Rectangle {
  setWidth(width: number) {
    this.width = width;
    this.height = width; // 改变了父类的行为
  }
  
  setHeight(height: number) {
    this.width = height;
    this.height = height;
  }
}

// ✅ 遵循：使用组合而非继承
interface Shape {
  area(): number;
}

class Rectangle implements Shape {
  constructor(private width: number, private height: number) {}
  
  area(): number {
    return this.width * this.height;
  }
}

class Square implements Shape {
  constructor(private side: number) {}
  
  area(): number {
    return this.side * this.side;
  }
}
```

**I - 接口隔离原则 (Interface Segregation)**
```typescript
// ❌ 违反：臃肿的接口
interface Worker {
  work(): void;
  eat(): void;
  sleep(): void;
  code(): void;
  design(): void;
}

// ✅ 遵循：精简的接口
interface Workable {
  work(): void;
}

interface Eatable {
  eat(): void;
}

interface Sleepable {
  sleep(): void;
}

interface Codeable {
  code(): void;
}

class Developer implements Workable, Eatable, Sleepable, Codeable {
  work() { /*...*/ }
  eat() { /*...*/ }
  sleep() { /*...*/ }
  code() { /*...*/ }
}
```

**D - 依赖倒置原则 (Dependency Inversion)**
```typescript
// ❌ 违反：依赖具体实现
class UserService {
  private api = new HttpClient(); // 硬编码依赖
  
  async getUser(id: string) {
    return this.api.get(`/users/${id}`);
  }
}

